The Zed extension provides tree-sitter grammars and LSP integration.

## Installation

See the Zed extension marketplace or `editors/zed/README.md` for installation instructions.

## Limitations

Zed does not support custom command handlers in extensions. Features that require editor-side prompts (like "Create linked resource") are not available in Zed.

List continuation on enter is not available in Zed for custom languages.
